- RegionJourneyCore: optional route.board (journey world) — over the last blendM metres the lens leaves follow/Landing A on ONE
  smootherstep (position lerp, view slerp, FOV lerp), monotonic, at rest where she stops; routes without board unchanged.
- RegionBoardLanding (pure): board pose per region/screen = meadowScenePose(aspect) / skycityVisitPose(spawn, court, aspect)
  exactly as the board backgrounds write it, mapped onto the journey copy (J·B⁻¹); blendM meadow 12 m (10 s), skycity 22 m (18 s);
