- RegionJourneyAdapter: route.board for the board UI viewport + map registered/dropped with the lease.
- WorldNativeComposition: meadow/skycity hook; holdEnterLevel only on ok and only when that background renders.
- test-region-landing-hook.cjs (suite): swap ≤0.1°/≤0.1° FOV/≤1 cm on 5 screens × 2 regions on the real GLB scene, clearance
